  "@type": "tm:ThingModel",
  "title": "Janitza UMG 96-PA Power Analyser",
  "description": "Thing Model for the Janitza UMG 96-PA power analyser over RS-485 Modbus RTU. It reads voltages, currents, active, apparent and reactive power, fundamental power factors, frequency, rotation field, obtained and supplied active energy, apparent energy, inductive and capacitive reactive energy and THD from the list of frequently required measured values in the user manual, document 2.061.015.3d, version 06/2020, chapter 19.1. All values are IEEE 754 floats with the high word first. Rows 19054–19060 and 19086–19092 are marked as differing from other UMG devices and repeat other rows' names, so they are omitted. The complete Modbus address list on janitza.de is not covered. The manual covers firmware 1. No hardware validation is claimed.",
  "modpoll:version": "0.2",
